Floating down a mountain, started as a drop  
No matter what stands in your way, you never stop  
Shallow in places, in others you roar  
A mystery I keep falling for
 
You flow in colours, support all the life
somewhere warm as spring somewhere frozen ice
      
I know the water in my hands is never the same
flowing from the mountains, fertilizing plains
 for someone carrying so much strength in you look pretty calm
I would love to live by your side and ear all our songs
  
  
            
      
